    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you can make a DC 15 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a> check to assist any allied <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starfighter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starfighter\">Starfighter</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Airspeeder\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Airspeeder\">Airspeeder</a> within 2 squares at <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Scale\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship Scale\">Starship Scale</a>. If you succeed, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot_(Vehicle_Combat)\" title=\"Pilot (Vehicle Combat)\">Pilot</a> of that Vehicle gains a +5 bonus on all opposed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a> checks relating to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dogfight\" title=\"Dogfight\">Dogfight</a> Action until the start of your next turn.",
